hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"136","Allahumma-kfini bihalalika an haramika, wa aghnini bika fadlika amman siwak.. O Allah, suffice me with Your lawful against Your unlawful, and enrich me by Your grace from all others besides You."
"137","Allāhumma innī a`ūdhu bika mina ‘l-ḥammi wa ‘l-ḥazan, wa ‘l-`ajzi wa ‘l-kasal, wa ‘l-bukhli wa ‘l-jubn, wa ḍala`id-dayni wa ghalabatir-rijāl. O Allah! I seek refuge with You from worry and grief, from incapacity and laziness, from cowardice and miserliness, from being heavily in debt and from being overpowered by (other) men. Reference: Al-Bukhari 7/158."
